B.lC=new A.bL(B.bCw,["The booking, prices, payments or selected stock changed. Refresh the current booking, then review your preserved draft again.","This payment has already been corrected. Refresh to see its replacement.","This correction request has already changed. Refresh the booking.","The original payment is preserved in history. Correct its active replacement instead.","Check the customer name, phone, product selections, delivery date and amounts. Phone must contain 10\u201315 digits, with an optional + prefix.","Choose a payment mode and a positive amount with at most two decimal places. Enter a correction reason.","Choose an active Finance provider and attach its image or PDF proof.","Enter a transaction reference of at least 3 characters.","Enter the expected delivery date.","Only Requested transfers can be edited. Requested or In transit transfers can be cancelled. Received transfers are final.","Remove a current item or reduce a quantity. Refresh if this transfer has changed.","Enter a whole quantity. Use 0 to remove the item.","You can only decrease this quantity. To increase it, cancel this transfer and create a new one.","This transfer reservation changed. Refresh and review the transfer.","Use the Mela transfer controls for this transfer.","This historical payment contains multiple methods and requires a separate correction review.","This password was not accepted. Choose a different password with at least 8 characters.",u.i,u.dB,"A physical count shortage is unresolved. Super Admin must open Daily physical count and review the shortage before this stock can be used.","This shortage affects reserved stock. Resolve the affected booking, preparation or transfer reservation, then refresh and review the shortage again.","Select the exact missing stock items. Identified stock cannot be removed by quantity alone.","The selected missing items are unavailable or do not match this shortage. Refresh and select only the exact missing items.","Choose the resolution, explain what you checked, and type CONFIRM.","This shortage was already resolved or is unavailable. Refresh the count history.","Another physical count was submitted after this snapshot. Create a fresh count sheet.","Enter a count for every item. Enter 0 when none are physically present.","Add a remark explaining every difference from the printed count.","This sheet was submitted or is no longer available. Choose an open sheet or create a new one.","These numbers belong to different scooters. Check the VIN, motor and controller numbers on the same scooter, then try again.","These numbers do not match the saved stock item. Check every number and the selected model before trying again.","These numbers do not identify one stock item. Check the full numbers on the item or ask Management for help.","We could not confirm these stock numbers. Refresh, check the full numbers on the item and try again.","This stock item is already used by another booking. Check that booking or choose a different item.","This stock item is not available to pick. Refresh stock and choose an available item.","This stock item is already being prepared for another job. Open that job or choose another item.","The saved stock item no longer matches these numbers or is unavailable. Refresh, check its numbers and location, then try again.",u.bs,u.p,"This Mela cannot receive a new transfer now. Check its dates or choose another destination.","Mela stock can be returned only after the event ends. Check the end time before trying again.","Choose an active sales branch to receive this Mela return.","Review this Mela transfer and type CONFIRM before reserving it. Reload the page if the review is missing.","The Mela packages or prices changed. Refresh the transfer review, check the summary and type CONFIRM again.","Reload this page to review battery packages and shared Mela prices for all selected colours.","Enter a positive Mela price with up to 2 decimal places for every selected package.","Choose one or more battery packages for each missing vehicle and colour, without selecting the same package twice.","A selected vehicle or battery is not active in this Mela\u2019s item list. Check the Mela setup or remove that item.","Review which vehicles are already counted in manual Virtual stock. Each vehicle can be counted only once.","Manual Virtual stock changed. Open Review manual Virtual counts on this transfer, correct the ticked vehicles, then dispatch again.","The Mela does not have enough unreserved stock for this transfer. Refresh stock and reduce the selected quantity.","Incoming transfer stock cannot be subtracted manually. Receive the transfer when it arrives, or check its transfer record.","This item is already reserved for a transfer. Check that transfer before using the item.","This vehicle is already held for a booking. Check the booking before using it elsewhere.","Change this stock through its Mela or a transfer in Stock tools.","Use a transfer in Stock tools to move stock into or out of this Mela.","This stock belongs to a different Mela. Refresh and choose the correct event\u2019s stock.","Change this Mela\u2019s Graphene cells through its booking or transfer. Refresh stock before continuing.","The Mela base branch cannot be changed after its stock location is created.","This location belongs to a Mela. Open the Mela to manage it.","This action is available only for a Mela transfer. Refresh and open the correct transfer.",u.L,"Pick all batteries needed for this booking.","Pick a charger and enter its serial number.","Enter the VIN, motor and controller numbers in Prepare booking.","A product in this booking is no longer in use. Ask Management to check the product setup.",u.fV,"More than the total has been paid. Finish the extra payment refund before creating the final bill.","This booking is already closed. Open Bookings to check its final status.",u.d,"This step was already tried with different details. Refresh and check what was saved before trying again.","Choose a branch that is in use. Refresh the branch list if needed.","Choose a model from the list. Refresh the list if it is out of date.","Choose a model and colour from the list.","Enter the customer\u2019s full name.","Choose when the customer plans to buy.","This phone number is already saved with different customer details. Check the name and phone number.","Choose different start and end times for the allowed work hours.","Choose a finance company that is in use.","Add finance proof before saving the payment.","Choose the finance company and enter the loan number.","Enter an amount above 0 and no more than the amount left to pay.","Enter a 10-digit phone number.","Preparation has started or this booking is closed. Refresh to see the current status.","Enter a reason for changing preparation.","Choose whether to use technician preparation.","Refresh this booking before changing preparation.","You cannot open or change this job. Ask your supervisor to check your access.","Only the technician assigned to this job can do this. Ask your supervisor to check the assignment.","Only Management can do this. Ask your supervisor for help.","Choose the branches where this person can do technical work.","This job is already finished or cancelled. Refresh the job list.","The person assigned to this job changed. Refresh the job before continuing.","This person cannot do this job at this branch. Choose another person or ask Super Admin to check their access.","Enter why you are changing the technician and a note about the work left to do. Use at least 5 letters in each.","This job is not assigned to you. Ask your supervisor to assign it.","Start this job before saving checks or stock changes.",u.m,"Pick all items, enter their stock numbers, and finish all four checks before sending this job for review.","The technician must finish the checks and mark this job Ready first.","Someone who did not work on this job must check it. Ask another supervisor to review it.","Enter a reason with at least 5 letters.","Enter why this job cannot continue. Use at least 3 letters.","A supervisor must check and approve the prepared scooter before you create the final bill.",u.eV,u.l,"Please enter your phone number and password and sign in again.","Finish the sign-in check, then try again.","Sign-in is not working right now. Wait a few minutes, then try again.","Please sign in again to continue.",u.hg,"Your account is not ready to use or its access is turned off. Ask Management to check your account.","Your account is not set up for this app. Ask Management to check your role.","Only Management can do this. Ask Management for help.","Choose an active colour for the same vehicle model.","Only Super Admin can do this. Ask Super Admin for help.",u.ah,"This action is not allowed at this time. Try during your allowed work hours or ask Management.","Your current password is not correct. Enter it again.","Open Profile to change your own password. You will need your current password.","The password details changed. Close this form and enter them again.","A newer password change has replaced this one. Close this form and start again.","A password change is already in progress. Wait a moment, then check again.",u.dN,u.dN,"Your password may have changed. Keep this form open and try again with the same details.","We could not change your password. Keep the same details and try again.","Another manager is changing this password. Wait a moment, then refresh.","This password change is still in progress. Wait a moment, then refresh.","The password changed, but the final check is still running. Keep the same details and try again.","We are still checking whether this account was created. Keep the same details and try again.","Account access changed, but the final check is still running. Keep this page open and try again.","Another manager is changing this account. Wait a moment, then refresh.","We could not check your current password. Wait a moment, then try again.",u.d,"Some details could not be accepted. Check the form fields and try again.","The customer details changed while you were working. Refresh and check them again.","A required Mela message is unavailable. Ask a Super Admin to check Message templates, then try again.",u.gv,u.dc,"This preparation changed elsewhere. Cancel editing, refresh the job and review the latest details before trying again.","This preparation can no longer be edited with your access. Refresh the job. Only Super Admin can correct it after Ready.","Preparation editing is closed at this stage. Refresh the job to see its current status.","Keep the complete battery pack recorded for this job. Refresh and review the saved batteries.","Check the stock numbers, photos and reason for these changes.","This stock number or the Booking stage changed since it was loaded. Refresh verification, review the saved details and try again.","This message was edited elsewhere. Copy your changes, close the editor and refresh before editing again.","Only the assigned Mela Cashier or Super Admin can do this. Ask them for help.","Only Mela Staff, Cashiers assigned to this Mela, or Super Admin can add an enquiry. Ask Management to check your Mela role.","This Mela is not open for new enquiries. Check its dates or ask Management.","Enter all 12 Aadhaar digits. When editing, leave the field blank to keep the saved Aadhaar.","We cannot save Aadhaar details right now. Try later or ask Management for help.","This booking could not be found. Refresh the booking list and open it again.","This enquiry could not be found. Refresh the enquiry list and open it again.","This payment could not be found. Refresh the booking and check its payments.","This payment already has proof. Open the payment to view it.","No proof is attached to this payment. Ask the person who saved the payment to add it.","You cannot view this payment proof. Ask Management for help.","The time allowed to add payment proof has ended. Ask Management for help.","We could not open the payment proof. Refresh the payment and try again.","No photo is attached to this refund. Ask Management to check the refund.","This photo upload has ended. Choose the photo again.","This photo has no data. Choose another photo.","This photo is empty or too large. Choose a smaller photo and try again.","This photo is too large. Choose a smaller photo.","We cannot use this photo size. Choose a smaller photo or take a new one.","This file is too large. Choose a file no larger than 10 MB.","This photo is too large. Choose a photo no larger than 10 MB.","Choose a JPG, PNG, or WebP photo.","Choose a JPG, PNG, WebP, or PDF file.","Choose a JPG, PNG, or WebP photo.","This file cannot be read as a photo. Take a new photo or choose another file.","This file does not match its file type. Choose another file.","PDF files can be used only for finance proof. For this payment, choose a photo.","Too many photos were uploaded at once. Wait a moment, then try again.","A photo is still uploading. Wait for it to finish.","This photo upload took too long. Choose the photo again.","You cannot add a photo here. Ask Management to check your access.","We could not open this photo. Refresh and try again.","We could not save this photo. Check your internet and try again.","We are still checking whether the photo was saved. Keep the same photo selected and try again.","The photo upload did not finish. Keep the same photo selected and try again.","This job changed while you were working. Refresh the job and check its photos.","A different photo is already being saved. Wait for it to finish, then check the job.","This job photo could not be found. Refresh the job and check its photos.","Prices changed after the file was checked. Check the file again and review the new prices before adding stock.","Stock numbers changed after the file was checked. Check the file again before adding stock.","The products in this stock file have changed. Download a new template, fill it in, and upload it again.","Some rows need fixing. Use the row numbers and field names below to fix the file, then upload it again.","No stock was added. Fix the row errors shown below, then check the file again.","We are still checking the file upload. Keep the same file selected and try again.","This stock template is out of date. Download a new template and fill it in.",u.B,"This stock file has expired. Download a new template and fill it in.","The stock template details are missing or changed. Download a new template and fill it in.","Choose the Excel stock file to upload.","Choose an Excel file ending in .xlsx.","This Excel file is too large. Choose a file no larger than 10 MB.","This report is still being made. Wait a moment, then refresh the report list.","We could not download the report. Refresh the report list and try again.","Choose a start and end date no more than 366 days apart.","We could not make the bill PDF. Open the booking and try the PDF download again.","We could not save the bill PDF. Open the booking and try the PDF download again.","The bill PDF is not ready yet. Open the booking and try the PDF download again.","The bill PDF is not ready. Open the booking and check the final bill.","We could not download the bill PDF. Open the booking and try the download again."],t.l)
